    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Park House is a small exclusive development of attractive contemporary spacious  homes, conveniently situated just off Dublin Street in Baldoyle within a few minutes’ walk of Baldoyle's Strand Road and promenade. \r\n \r\nNo 18 is one of 17 spacious three storey A rated family homes located overlooking a shared open green area to the front and a good sized private South facing garden to the rear. \r\n \r\nAll who visit this stunning home will be suitable impressed by the bright light filled accommodation on offer which combined with an A3 BER rating make for very comfortable living enjoyment for all the family. \r\n \r\nThe accommodation comprises an open entrance porch area with access to the garage. An entrance hallway with wc and store room, to the rear is a large open plan kitchen / dining room with a utility room off and double doors leading to the private and landscaped South facing garden. On the first floor to the front is the main bedroom which has a walk in wardrobe, en-suite and access to a balcony which looks over the green to the front. To the rear is the living room with a second balcony which looks South over the rear garden. On the second floor there are 2 further bedrooms and a bathroom.\r\n \r\nAll amenities this ever popular location has to offer are within easy reach to include both primary and secondary schools, local shopping in Sutton Cross and Baldoyle. Bus and dart services. Relaxing coastal walks. Dublin Airport, the M50 and the M1 motorways are also within easy reach.\r\n \r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
